@ref Rg 6 as amended by S 210/2010 (src:TA1999-RG6-S210-2010:15-369)
GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Rg 6 reg 3(9) (deleted from 15 April 2010): the holder of a Dealer's Class Licence must notify the Authority of a change in any particular within 14 days under regulation 3(9)` MEANS
    BRANCH IF d LESS THAN (Date 21 7 2005) THEN NOTHING
           IF d LESS THAN (Date 15 4 2010) THEN JUST TRUE
           OTHERWISE JUST FALSE

GIVEN d IS A DATE
      `days after a change in any particular furnished under regulation 3, that the Class Licensee notified the Authority` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Rg 6 Second Schedule item 10A (from 15 April 2010): the Class Licensee is meeting the condition` MEANS
    BRANCH IF d LESS THAN (Date 15 4 2010) THEN NOTHING
           OTHERWISE JUST (`days after a change in any particular furnished under regulation 3, that the Class Licensee notified the Authority` AT MOST 14)

GIVEN d IS A DATE
      `days after a change in personal particulars specified in the licence, that the holder notified the Authority` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Rg 6 reg 4(9) (from 15 April 2010): the condition of the Dealer's Individual Licence is met` MEANS
    BRANCH IF d LESS THAN (Date 15 4 2010) THEN NOTHING
           OTHERWISE JUST (`days after a change in personal particulars specified in the licence, that the holder notified the Authority` AT MOST 14)

GIVEN d IS A DATE
      `which period of 5 years or part thereof, counting from 1` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
`Rg 6 reg 10(1) (from 15 April 2010): the fee for a Dealer's Individual Licence for each period of 5 years or part thereof, in dollars` MEANS
    BRANCH IF d LESS THAN (Date 15 4 2010) THEN NOTHING
           OTHERWISE JUST 250

GIVEN d IS A DATE
      `the person notified the Authority of the intended import before the equipment was imported, and furnished the particulars in the form determined` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Rg 6 reg 18(1) (from 15 April 2010): the person may import telecommunication equipment` MEANS
    BRANCH IF d LESS THAN (Date 15 4 2010) THEN NOTHING
           OTHERWISE JUST `the person notified the Authority of the intended import before the equipment was imported, and furnished the particulars in the form determined`

GIVEN d IS A DATE
      `the equipment is set out in the Third Schedule` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the Authority gave its prior approval` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the person obtained a permit under the Regulation of Imports and Exports Regulations before the equipment was imported` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Rg 6 reg 18(2) and (3) (from 15 April 2010): the person may import the telecommunication equipment set out in the Third Schedule` MEANS
    BRANCH IF d LESS THAN (Date 15 4 2010) THEN NOTHING
           OTHERWISE JUST ((NOT `the equipment is set out in the Third Schedule`) OR (`the Authority gave its prior approval` AND `the person obtained a permit under the Regulation of Imports and Exports Regulations before the equipment was imported`))

GIVEN d IS A DATE
      `the person furnishes false or misleading information to the Authority under paragraph (1), or to obtain approval under paragraph (2), or falsifies or fabricates a decision of the Authority on that application` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Rg 6 reg 18(4) and (5) (from 15 April 2010): the person has breached the regulation` MEANS
    BRANCH IF d LESS THAN (Date 15 4 2010) THEN NOTHING
           OTHERWISE JUST `the person furnishes false or misleading information to the Authority under paragraph (1), or to obtain approval under paragraph (2), or falsifies or fabricates a decision of the Authority on that application`

GIVEN d IS A DATE
      `the Authority required, or the applicant voluntarily submitted, the results of the certification or tests for evaluation` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Rg 6 reg 20(5) (from 15 April 2010): the Authority may evaluate the results` MEANS
    BRANCH IF d LESS THAN (Date 15 4 2010) THEN NOTHING
           OTHERWISE JUST `the Authority required, or the applicant voluntarily submitted, the results of the certification or tests for evaluation`

GIVEN d IS A DATE
      `the equipment is set out in the Fifth Schedule and its registration did not require or involve an evaluation of the declaration of conformity` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Rg 6 reg 20(7A) (from 15 April 2010): no renewal fee is payable for the registration` MEANS
    BRANCH IF d LESS THAN (Date 15 4 2010) THEN NOTHING
           OTHERWISE JUST `the equipment is set out in the Fifth Schedule and its registration did not require or involve an evaluation of the declaration of conformity`

GIVEN d IS A DATE
      `the licensee intends to sell equipment for which no approval for sale is required under regulation 20(1)` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the application is in the form and manner determined, with the Fourth Schedule fee and a declaration of conformity based on certification or tests by a body the Authority specified` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the applicant satisfies the requirements in the regulation` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Rg 6 reg 20A(1) to (5) (from 15 April 2010): the Authority may provide a confirmation of conformity` MEANS
    BRANCH IF d LESS THAN (Date 15 4 2010) THEN NOTHING
           OTHERWISE JUST (`the licensee intends to sell equipment for which no approval for sale is required under regulation 20(1)` AND `the application is in the form and manner determined, with the Fourth Schedule fee and a declaration of conformity based on certification or tests by a body the Authority specified` AND `the applicant satisfies the requirements in the regulation`)

GIVEN d IS A DATE
      `the modification is likely to affect the equipment's compliance with the published standards` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE (LIST OF NUMBER)
`Rg 6 reg 20A(6) (from 15 April 2010): the Authority may require a new application, or amend the confirmation of conformity for an amendment fee in dollars` MEANS
    BRANCH IF d LESS THAN (Date 15 4 2010) THEN NOTHING
           IF `the modification is likely to affect the equipment's compliance with the published standards` THEN JUST (LIST 0)
           OTHERWISE JUST (LIST 100)

GIVEN d IS A DATE
      `the applicant furnishes false or misleading information to obtain a registration, renewal, amendment or confirmation of conformity` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Rg 6 reg 21 (from 15 April 2010): the applicant has breached the regulation` MEANS
    BRANCH IF d LESS THAN (Date 15 4 2010) THEN NOTHING
           OTHERWISE JUST `the applicant furnishes false or misleading information to obtain a registration, renewal, amendment or confirmation of conformity`

GIVEN d IS A DATE
      `the person imports telecommunication equipment set out in the Third Schedule without the Authority's approval` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Rg 6 reg 23(a) (from 15 April 2010): the Authority may direct the person to dispose of the equipment` MEANS
    BRANCH IF d LESS THAN (Date 15 4 2010) THEN NOTHING
           OTHERWISE JUST `the person imports telecommunication equipment set out in the Third Schedule without the Authority's approval`

GIVEN d IS A DATE
      `type of application` IS A STRING
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
`Rg 6 Fourth Schedule (from 15 April 2010): the fee in dollars for an application for registration or confirmation of conformity` MEANS
    BRANCH IF d LESS THAN (Date 15 4 2010) THEN NOTHING
           IF `type of application` EQUALS "requiring or involving evaluation by the Authority: radio-communication or single-line equipment" THEN JUST 350
           IF `type of application` EQUALS "requiring or involving evaluation by the Authority: complex or multi-line equipment" THEN JUST 500
           IF `type of application` EQUALS "requiring or involving evaluation by a local or foreign certification body recognised by the Authority" THEN JUST 100
           IF `type of application` EQUALS "not requiring or involving evaluation: telecommunication equipment set out in the Fifth Schedule" THEN JUST 0
           IF `type of application` EQUALS "not requiring or involving evaluation: any other telecommunication equipment" THEN JUST 100
           OTHERWISE NOTHING

GIVEN d IS A DATE
      `equipment category of Fifth Schedule item 2 (Complex or multi-line equipment)` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE STRING
`Rg 6 Fifth Schedule item 2 (from 15 April 2010): the authorised radio frequency bands and maximum field strength or power` MEANS
    BRANCH IF d LESS THAN (Date 15 4 2010) THEN NOTHING
           IF `equipment category of Fifth Schedule item 2 (Complex or multi-line equipment)` THEN JUST "Not applicable"
           OTHERWISE NOTHING

GIVEN `authorised radio frequency band` IS A STRING
GIVETH A MAYBE (LIST OF STRING)
`Rg 6 Fifth Schedule item 1 as substituted by S 210/2010 (15 April 2010): the maximum approved field strengths or powers for the band` MEANS
    BRANCH IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "(none)" THEN NOTHING
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "16-150 kHz" THEN JUST (LIST "100 dBµV/m @ 3m or 66 dBµA/m @ 3m")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "510-1600 kHz" THEN JUST (LIST "57 dBµV/m @ 3m")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "150-5000 kHz" THEN JUST (LIST "47.5 dBµV/m @ 10m or 13.5 dBµA/m @ 10m")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "1605-1800 kHz" THEN JUST (LIST "94 dBµV/m @ 3m")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "6765-6795 kHz" THEN JUST (LIST "76 dBµV/m @ 10m or 42 dBµA/m @ 10m")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "7400-8800 kHz" THEN JUST (LIST "43 dBµV/m @ 10m or 9 dBµA/m @ 10m")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "13.553-13.567 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "94 dBµV/m @ 10m")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "26.960-27.280 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "500 mW ERP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "29.700-30.000 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "500 mW ERP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "34.995-35.225 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "100 mW ERP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "40.000-40.500 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "57 dBµV/m @ 3m")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "40.500-41.00 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "0.01 mW ERP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "40.660-40.700 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "65 dBµV/m @ 10m", "500 mW ERP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "40.770-40.830 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "500 mW ERP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "43.720-47.000 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "90 dBµV/m @ 3m")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "48.760-50.000 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "90 dBµV/m @ 3m")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "72.080 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "1000 mW ERP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "72.130-72.210 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "500 mW ERP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "72.200 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "1000 mW ERP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "72.400 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "1000 mW ERP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "72.600 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "1000 mW ERP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "88.000-108.000 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "60 dBµV/m @ 10m")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "146.350-146.500 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "100 mW ERP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "151.125 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "1000 mW ERP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "151.150 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "1000 mW ERP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "158.275/162.875 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "1000 mW ERP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "158.325/162.925 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "1000 mW ERP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "169.400-175.000 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "500 mW ERP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "180.000-200.000 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "112 dBµV/m @ 10m")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "216.000-217.000 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "100 mW ERP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "240.150-240.300 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "100 mW ERP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "300.000-300.300 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "100 mW ERP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "312.000-316.000 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "100 mW ERP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "433.050-434.790 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "10 mW ERP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "444.400-444.800 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "100 mW ERP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "446.000-446.100 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "500 mW ERP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "453.7250/458.7250 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "1000 mW ERP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "453.7375/458.7375 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "1000 mW ERP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "453.7500/458.7500 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "1000 mW ERP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "453.7625/458.7625 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "1000 mW ERP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "454.000-454.500 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "2 mW ERP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "470.000-806.000 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "10 mW ERP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "477.000-477.250 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "500 mW ERP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "819.000-823.000 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "100 mW ERP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "866.000-869.000 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "500 mW ERP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "920.000-925.000 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "500 mW ERP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "1427-1432 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "100 mW ERP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "1880-1900 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "250 mW EIRP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "2400-2483.5 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "200 mW EIRP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "5150-5350 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "200 mW EIRP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "5725-5875 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "1000 mW EIRP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "10.500-10.550 GHz" THEN JUST (LIST "117 dBµV/m @ 10m")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "18.820-18.870 GHz" THEN JUST (LIST "500 mW EIRP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "19.160-19.210 GHz" THEN JUST (LIST "500 mW EIRP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "24.000-24.250 GHz" THEN JUST (LIST "100 mW EIRP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "76.000-77.000 GHz" THEN JUST (LIST "5 W EIRP for vehicle in motion, 250 mW EIRP for stationary vehicle")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "All frequencies" THEN JUST (LIST "25µW")
           OTHERWISE NOTHING


