-- src:TA1999-RG6-S251-2013:143 | 5,470-5,725 MHz 1000 mW EIRP
-- src:TA1999-RG6-S251-2013:144 | 5,725-5,875 MHz 1000 mW EIRP
-- src:TA1999-RG6-S251-2013:145 | 10.500-10.550 GHz 117 dBµV/m @ 10m
-- src:TA1999-RG6-S251-2013:146 | 18.820-18.870 GHz 500 mW EIRP
-- src:TA1999-RG6-S251-2013:147 | 19.160-19.210 GHz 500 mW EIRP
-- src:TA1999-RG6-S251-2013:148 | 5
-- src:TA1999-RG6-S251-2013:151 | 24.000-24.250 GHz 100 mW EIRP
-- src:TA1999-RG6-S251-2013:152 | 57.000-66.000 GHz 10 W EIRP
-- src:TA1999-RG6-S251-2013:153 | 76.000-77.000 GHz 5 W EIRP for vehicle in
-- src:TA1999-RG6-S251-2013:154 | motion, 250 mW EIRP
-- src:TA1999-RG6-S251-2013:155 | for stationary vehicle
-- src:TA1999-RG6-S251-2013:156 | All other frequencies 25 µW ERP
-- src:TA1999-RG6-S251-2013:158 | ”; and
@ref Rg 6 as amended by S 251/2013 (src:TA1999-RG6-S251-2013:18-158)
GIVEN d IS A DATE
      `the Authority approved the transfer` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Rg 6 reg 20(6A) to (6C) (from 25 April 2013): the licensee's registration of the equipment may be transferred to another licensee` MEANS
    BRANCH IF d LESS THAN (Date 25 4 2013) THEN NOTHING
           OTHERWISE JUST `the Authority approved the transfer`

GIVEN d IS A DATE
      `equipment` IS A STRING
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Rg 6 Third Schedule (from 25 April 2013): this is prohibited telecommunication equipment (item 5 replaced)` MEANS
    BRANCH IF d LESS THAN (Date 25 4 2013) THEN NOTHING
           OTHERWISE JUST (elem `equipment` (LIST "Scanning Receivers", "Military Communication Equipment", "Telephone Voice Changing Equipment"
                                              , "Radio-communication Equipment operating in frequency bands 880-915 MHz, 925-960 MHz, 1900-1980 MHz and 2110-2170 MHz except Cellular Mobile Phones or such other equipment approved by the Authority"
                                              , "Radio-communication Jamming Devices operating in any frequency band"))

GIVEN d IS A DATE
      `the licensee's equipment shares the technical specifications, design and electrical characteristics with, and yields the same test results as, equipment it previously registered` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
`Rg 6 Fourth Schedule item 4 (from 25 April 2013): the fee in dollars for an application by a licensee for registration of such equipment` MEANS
    BRANCH IF d LESS THAN (Date 25 4 2013) THEN NOTHING
           IF `the licensee's equipment shares the technical specifications, design and electrical characteristics with, and yields the same test results as, equipment it previously registered` THEN JUST 50
           OTHERWISE NOTHING

GIVEN `authorised radio frequency band` IS A STRING
GIVETH A MAYBE (LIST OF STRING)
`Rg 6 Fifth Schedule item 1 as substituted by S 251/2013 (25 April 2013): the maximum approved field strengths or powers for the band` MEANS
    BRANCH IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "(none)" THEN NOTHING
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "9-315 kHz" THEN JUST (LIST "30 dBµA/m @ 10m")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "16-150 kHz" THEN JUST (LIST "100 dBµV/m @ 3m or 66 dBµA/m @ 10m")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "150-5,000 kHz" THEN JUST (LIST "13.5 dBµA/m @ 10m")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "510-1,600 kHz" THEN JUST (LIST "57 dBµV/m @ 3m")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "1,605-1,800 kHz" THEN JUST (LIST "94 dBµV/m @ 3m")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "6,765-6,795 kHz" THEN JUST (LIST "42 dBµA/m @ 10m")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "7,400-8,800 kHz" THEN JUST (LIST "9 dBµA/m @ 10m")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "13.553-13.567 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "94 dBµV/m @ 10m")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "26.960-27.280 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "500 mW ERP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "29.700-30.000 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "500 mW ERP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "34.995-35.225 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "100 mW ERP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "40.000-40.500 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "57 dBµV/m @ 3m")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "40.500-41.00 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "0.01 mW ERP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "40.660-40.700 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "65 dBµV/m @ 10m", "500 mW ERP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "40.770-40.830 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "500 mW ERP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "43.720-47.000 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "90 dBµV/m @ 3m")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "48.760-50.000 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "90 dBµV/m @ 3m")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "72.080 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "1000 mW ERP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "72.130-72.210 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "500 mW ERP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "72.200 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "1000 mW ERP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "72.400 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "1000 mW ERP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "72.600 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "1000 mW ERP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "88.000-108.000 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "60 dBµV/m @ 10m")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "146.350-146.500 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "100 mW ERP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "151.125 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "1000 mW ERP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "151.150 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "1000 mW ERP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "158.275/162.875 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "1000 mW ERP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "158.325/162.925 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "1000 mW ERP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "169.400-175.000 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "500 mW ERP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "180.000-200.000 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "112 dBµV/m @ 10m")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "216.000-217.000 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "100 mW ERP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "240.150-240.300 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "100 mW ERP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "300.000-300.300 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "100 mW ERP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "312.000-316.000 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "100 mW ERP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "433.050-434.790 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "10 mW ERP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "444.400-444.800 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "100 mW ERP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "446.000-446.100 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "500 mW ERP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "453.7250/458.7250 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "1000 mW ERP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "453.7375/458.7375 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "1000 mW ERP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "453.7500/458.7500 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "1000 mW ERP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "453.7625/458.7625 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "1000 mW ERP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "454.000-454.500 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "2 mW ERP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "470.000-806.000 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "10 mW ERP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "477.000-477.250 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "500 mW ERP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "819.000-823.000 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "100 mW ERP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "866.000-869.000 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "500 mW ERP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "920.000-925.000 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "500 mW ERP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "1,427-1,432 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "100 mW ERP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "1,880-1,900 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "250 mW EIRP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "2,400-2,483.5 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "200 mW EIRP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "5,150-5,350 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "200 mW EIRP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "5,470-5,725 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "1000 mW EIRP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "5,725-5,875 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "1000 mW EIRP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "10.500-10.550 GHz" THEN JUST (LIST "117 dBµV/m @ 10m")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "18.820-18.870 GHz" THEN JUST (LIST "500 mW EIRP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "19.160-19.210 GHz" THEN JUST (LIST "500 mW EIRP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "24.000-24.250 GHz" THEN JUST (LIST "100 mW EIRP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "57.000-66.000 GHz" THEN JUST (LIST "10 W EIRP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "76.000-77.000 GHz" THEN JUST (LIST "5 W EIRP for vehicle in motion, 250 mW EIRP for stationary vehicle")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "All other frequencies" THEN JUST (LIST "25 µW ERP")
           OTHERWISE NOTHING


