§ `S 725/2014 (in operation 1 November 2014)`

-- src:TA1999-RG6-S725-2014:18 | 1. These Regulations may be cited as the Telecommunications
-- src:TA1999-RG6-S725-2014:19 | (Dealers) (Amendment No. 2) Regulations 2014 and shall come into
