@ref Rg 6 Fifth Schedule item 1 as substituted by S 589/2023 (paragraph 4) (src:TA1999-RG6-S589-2023:39-109)
GIVEN `authorised radio frequency band` IS A STRING
GIVETH A MAYBE (LIST OF STRING)
`Rg 6 Fifth Schedule item 1 as substituted by S 589/2023 (1 September 2023): the maximum approved field strengths or powers for the band` MEANS
    BRANCH IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "(none)" THEN NOTHING
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "9-315 kHz" THEN JUST (LIST "30 dBµA/m @ 10m")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "16-150 kHz" THEN JUST (LIST "100 dBµV/m @ 3m", "66 dBµA/m @ 10m")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "150-5,000 kHz" THEN JUST (LIST "13.5 dBµA/m @ 10m")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "510-1,600 kHz" THEN JUST (LIST "57 dBµV/m @ 3m")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "6,765-6,795 kHz" THEN JUST (LIST "42 dBµA/m @ 10m")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "7,400-8,800 kHz" THEN JUST (LIST "9 dBµA/m @ 10m")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "10.200-11.000 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "9 dBµA/m @ 10m")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "13.553-13.567 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "94 dBµV/m @ 10m", "10 mW ERP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "26.960-27.280 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "500 mW ERP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "29.700-30.000 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "10 mW ERP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "34.995-35.225 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "100 mW ERP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "40.500-41.000 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "0.01 mW ERP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "40.660-40.700 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "65 dBµV/m @ 10m", "500 mW ERP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "72.080 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "1000 mW ERP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "72.130-72.210 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "500 mW ERP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "72.200 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "1000 mW ERP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "72.400 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "1000 mW ERP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "72.600 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "1000 mW ERP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "88.000-108.000 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "60 dBµV/m @ 10m")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "146.350-146.500 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "100 mW ERP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "151.125 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "1000 mW ERP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "151.150 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "1000 mW ERP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "158.275/162.875 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "1000 mW ERP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "158.325/162.925 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "1000 mW ERP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "169.400-175.000 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "500 mW ERP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "180.000-200.000 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "50 mW ERP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "216.000-217.000 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "100 mW ERP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "240.150-240.300 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "100 mW ERP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "300.000-300.300 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "100 mW ERP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "312.000-316.000 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "100 mW ERP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "433.050-434.790 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "10 mW ERP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "444.400-444.800 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "100 mW ERP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "446.000-446.100 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "500 mW ERP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "446.325-446.475 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "500 mW ERP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "470.000-534.000 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "50 mW ERP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "487.000-507.000 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "112 dBµV/m @ 10m")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "534.000-614.000 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "10 mW ERP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "614.000-698.000 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "50 mW ERP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "866.000-869.000 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "500 mW ERP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "917.000-925.000 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "500 mW ERP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "1,880-1,900 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "250 mW EIRP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "2,400-2,483.5 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "200 mW EIRP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "5,150-5,350 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "200 mW EIRP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "5,470-5,725 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "1000 mW EIRP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "5,725-5,875 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "1000 mW EIRP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "5,945-6,425 MHz" THEN JUST (LIST "250 mW EIRP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "10.500-10.550 GHz" THEN JUST (LIST "117 dBµV/m @ 10m")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "24.000-24.250 GHz" THEN JUST (LIST "100 mW EIRP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "57.000-66.000 GHz" THEN JUST (LIST "10 W EIRP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "76.000-77.000 GHz" THEN JUST (LIST "55 dBm peak EIRP", "23.5 dBm average EIRP for pulse radar", "50 dBm average EIRP for other radar types")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "122.000-123.000 GHz" THEN JUST (LIST "100 mW EIRP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "244.000-246.000 GHz" THEN JUST (LIST "100 mW EIRP")
           IF `authorised radio frequency band` EQUALS "All other frequencies" THEN JUST (LIST "25 µW ERP")
           OTHERWISE NOTHING

-- src:TA1999-RG6-S589-2023:112 | Miscellaneous amendments
-- src:TA1999-RG6-S589-2023:113 | 5. In the principal Regulations —
-- src:TA1999-RG6-S589-2023:114 | (a) in regulation 2, in the definition of “identity card”, replace
-- src:TA1999-RG6-S589-2023:115 | “(Cap. 201)” with “1965”;
-- src:TA1999-RG6-S589-2023:116 | (b) in regulations 3(12)(c) and 7(b), replace “(Cap. 50)” with
-- src:TA1999-RG6-S589-2023:117 | “1967”;
-- src:TA1999-RG6-S589-2023:118 | (c) in regulations 3(12)(c) and 7(ba), delete “(Act 5 of 2005)”;
-- src:TA1999-RG6-S589-2023:119 | (d) in regulation 18(3), delete “Cap. 272A,”; and
-- src:TA1999-RG6-S589-2023:120 | (e) in the Second Schedule, in paragraph 6(1)(a), replace
-- src:TA1999-RG6-S589-2023:121 | “(Cap. 114)” with “1966”.
@ref Rg 6 as amended by S 589/2023, paragraph 5 (miscellaneous amendments) (src:TA1999-RG6-S589-2023:112-121)
-- The words replaced, by provision of the principal Regulations (paragraphs 2, 3 and 5 of S 589/2023).  "old" is the words the provision had; "new" is what S 589/2023 puts in their place.
GIVEN provision IS A STRING
GIVETH A MAYBE (LIST OF STRING)
`Rg 6 as amended by S 589/2023: the words replaced and the words that replace them in the provision (old, new)` MEANS
    BRANCH IF provision EQUALS "reg 3(12)(b)" THEN JUST (LIST "Business Registration Act (Cap. 32)", "Business Registration Act (Cap. 32, 2004 Revised Edition) (as in force before 3 January 2016) or the Business Names Registration Act 2014")
           IF provision EQUALS "reg 7(c)" THEN JUST (LIST "Business Registration Act (Cap. 32)", "Business Names Registration Act 2014")
           IF provision EQUALS "reg 2, definition of identity card" THEN JUST (LIST "(Cap. 201)", "1965")
           IF provision EQUALS "reg 3(12)(c)" THEN JUST (LIST "(Cap. 50)", "1967")
           IF provision EQUALS "reg 7(b)" THEN JUST (LIST "(Cap. 50)", "1967")
           IF provision EQUALS "reg 3(12)(c) and 7(ba)" THEN JUST (LIST "(Act 5 of 2005)", "(deleted)")
           IF provision EQUALS "reg 18(3)" THEN JUST (LIST "Cap. 272A,", "(deleted)")
           IF provision EQUALS "Second Schedule, paragraph 6(1)(a)" THEN JUST (LIST "(Cap. 114)", "1966")
           OTHERWISE NOTHING

-- Which paragraphs are in force on the conduct day, as read on the reading day.  Paragraphs 2 to 4: in operation 1 Sep 2023, first published 29 Aug 2023.  Paragraph 5: deemed in operation 31 Dec 2021, first published 29 Aug 2023.
GIVEN paragraph IS A NUMBER
      `conduct day` IS A DATE
      `reading day` IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`S 589/2023: the paragraph of the amending Regulations applies to conduct on the conduct day, as read on the reading day` MEANS
    `reading day` AT LEAST (Date 29 8 2023)
    AND BRANCH IF paragraph EQUALS 5 THEN `conduct day` AT LEAST (Date 31 12 2021)
               IF paragraph AT LEAST 2 AND paragraph AT MOST 4 THEN `conduct day` AT LEAST (Date 1 9 2023)
               OTHERWISE FALSE

§ `Rg 6 Fifth Schedule item 1 on the date`

GIVEN d IS A DATE
      `authorised radio frequency band` IS A STRING
GIVETH A MAYBE (LIST OF STRING)
`Rg 6 Fifth Schedule item 1: the maximum approved field strengths or powers for the band, on the date` MEANS
    BRANCH IF d LESS THAN (Date 23 7 2007) THEN NOTHING
           IF d LESS THAN (Date 15 4 2010) THEN `Rg 6 Fifth Schedule item 1 as inserted by S 396/2007: the maximum approved field strength or power for the band of Short Range Devices` d `authorised radio frequency band`
           IF d LESS THAN (Date 1 4 2011) THEN `Rg 6 Fifth Schedule item 1 as substituted by S 210/2010 (15 April 2010): the maximum approved field strengths or powers for the band` `authorised radio frequency band`
           IF d LESS THAN (Date 25 4 2013) THEN `Rg 6 Fifth Schedule item 1 as substituted by S 178/2011 (1 April 2011): the maximum approved field strengths or powers for the band` `authorised radio frequency band`
           IF d LESS THAN (Date 23 6 2014) THEN `Rg 6 Fifth Schedule item 1 as substituted by S 251/2013 (25 April 2013): the maximum approved field strengths or powers for the band` `authorised radio frequency band`
           IF d LESS THAN (Date 1 11 2014) THEN `Rg 6 Fifth Schedule item 1 as substituted by S 414/2014 (23 June 2014): the maximum approved field strengths or powers for the band` `authorised radio frequency band`
           IF d LESS THAN (Date 1 9 2023) THEN `Rg 6 Fifth Schedule item 1 as substituted by S 725/2014 (1 November 2014): the maximum approved field strengths or powers for the band` `authorised radio frequency band`
           OTHERWISE `Rg 6 Fifth Schedule item 1 as substituted by S 589/2023 (1 September 2023): the maximum approved field strengths or powers for the band` `authorised radio frequency band`
